## cmdinit — .forge-conventions

> Machine-readable convention file consumed by `forge lint`.
> Generated by forge new ts-service (forge 9.9.9-test).

convention: no-float-money
rule: Never use `number` for monetary values — use `bigint` (cents) in TypeScript and `NUMERIC(19,4)` in PostgreSQL.
severity: error
tags: correctness financial

convention: sql-params-only
rule: SQL queries must use $N placeholders. Never interpolate values into query strings.
severity: error
tags: security injection

convention: workspace-id-filter
rule: Every DB query against a tenant-scoped table must include a `workspace_id` filter.
severity: error
tags: security tenancy rls

convention: no-silent-errors
rule: Errors must never be silently discarded. Catch blocks must log or rethrow.
severity: error
tags: correctness reliability

convention: structured-logging
rule: Use pino for all production logging. No console.log in non-test code.
severity: error
tags: observability dx

convention: typed-error-classes
rule: Throw typed Error subclasses (AppError, AuthError, ValidationError) never raw strings.
severity: error
tags: correctness dx

convention: security-tests-for-rls
rule: Every new RLS policy or authz guard requires a test in tests/security/.
severity: error
tags: security testing

convention: co-located-tests
rule: Unit tests co-located as <module>.test.ts next to the source file.
severity: warning
tags: testing dx
